---
layout: base.njk
nav: reviews
title: "Reviews"
title_tag: "New Launch Condo Reviews Singapore | Terence Seah"
description: "Reviews of Singapore new launch condos: location, layouts, pricing and who each project suits. Written after visiting the show galleries in person."
permalink: /my-blog/index.html
---
<section class="opener wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">Every review</p>
  <h1>Singapore new launches, visited in person</h1>
  <p class="standfirst">Each one written after a show gallery visit, photographed by me, and ending with who the project suits and who should look elsewhere.</p>
</section>

<section class="section wrap">
  {% for r in collections.reviews | reverse %}
  <a class="entry" href="{{ r.url }}">
    <span class="idx">{{ r.data.index }}</span>
    <div>
      <h3 class="entry-title">{{ r.data.title }}</h3>
      <p class="entry-meta">{{ r.data.meta }} &middot; <span>{{ r.data.readtime }}</span></p>
      <p class="dek">{{ r.data.dek }}</p>
      <div class="tags">{% for t in r.data.tags_list %}<span class="tag">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="entry-thumb"><img src="{{ r.data.thumb }}" alt="{{ r.data.title }}"></div>
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
